From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:58:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): refuse unreasoned priority raise on an
 llm_pacing-held card [daveey]

hermes kanban edit raised t_eddbf5d5189531ec 900->1000 while the dispatcher
held it for llm_pacing, against the notice, a coach hint and the session's
own memory (self-heal agent-6f3c6009b5). The edit path only guarded
lowering. Now the CLI path (require_lower_reason) refuses a raise on a
ready card whose every candidate pool is paced/held (paced_pools, the
stall notice's read-only view) unless --reason is given; fails open.
---
